st":"0#0","dropbox_id":400104,"id":400104009,"item":"16#15","name":-1,"weight":700}],"text":{"ARENA_3V3_HELP":"Battle Rules|1. Player must deploy 3 teams of Girls. There must be at least 1 Girl on each team. Your team can be changed at any time.|2. Battles are “Best of Three.” The player who wins 2 battles is the winner.|3. Defeat all your enemy's Girls in 1 match to win the battle.|4. Each battle lasts 15 rounds. If the battle exceeds the time limit Girls remaining will increase their Attack and lower their Healing received each round until the battle is over.|5. Each battle adds or deducts from your rank depending on the outcome.|6. Players can check out the most recent 10 battle replays in Battle Record.","ARENA3V3_BATTLE_FORMATION_WINDOW":"Battle","ARENA_3V3_MISC":"Enemy detected\nEngage!","ARENA_3V3_NEW_SEASON_SERVER_TIME_TEXT":"Cross-server Varsity starts in:"}}